{"4195910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hamster Ballers", "steam_appid": 4195910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>friendship-ending, physics-based, ragebait game </strong>where you and a friend are hamsters trapped inside a hamster ball and you can't get out until you complete this obstacle course.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two Hamsters. One Ball. Zero Coordination.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get your best friend and roll through an impossible obstacle course, with <i>two twists</i>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't just hold a button to move. Each press instead shoves the ball, so you have to be constantly reacting to your speed and direction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In co-op, you have to match the number of inputs you make with your partner. If one person presses five times in a row without any input from your partner, the ball explodes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Online Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can't complete the course alone? Grab a friend to &quot;help&quot; you out!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play online co-op with one other friend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or play solo and take control of the hamster ball yourself. It is slippery. You will fall many times.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ball Physics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We modeled the hamster ball physics after the hamster ball that your pet hamster played in when you were a kid.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Good Luck</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will fall and explode... a lot. Good luck, and may hamster speed be with you.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>friendship-ending, physics-based, ragebait game </strong>where you and a friend are hamsters trapped inside a hamster ball and you can't get out until you complete this obstacle course.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two Hamsters. One Ball. Zero Coordination.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get your best friend and roll through an impossible obstacle course, with <i>two twists</i>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't just hold a button to move. Each press instead shoves the ball, so you have to be constantly reacting to your speed and direction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In co-op, you have to match the number of inputs you make with your partner. If one person presses five times in a row without any input from your partner, the ball explodes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Online Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can't complete the course alone? Grab a friend to &quot;help&quot; you out!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play online co-op with one other friend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or play solo and take control of the hamster ball yourself. It is slippery. You will fall many times.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ball Physics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We modeled the hamster ball physics after the hamster ball that your pet hamster played in when you were a kid.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Good Luck</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will fall and explode... a lot. Good luck, and may hamster speed be with you.</p>", "short_description": "A short, hilariously unfair, two-player obstacle course that'll more than answer the question: &quot;Would I lose my sanity if I were trapped in a hamster ball with this person and had to climb a stupid hazard filled mountain to get out?&quot;", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4195910/80abc799604cae4f25e5b993671698b2ddfce327/header.jpg?t=1786647411", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com